          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akimaj odaŋŋe matek ni, “Kabaka, piny tye maber.” Ci okulo wiye piny i nyim kabaka oryebbe kwede piny i ŋom kun waco ni, “Pwoc obed bot Rwot Lubaŋani, ma doŋ olari ki i ciŋ dano ma gutiŋo ciŋgi ka lweny i komi, laditta kabaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka openyo ni, “Lok mo marac pe i kom awobina Abcalom?” Akimaj ogamo ni, “I kare ma Joab cwala ki lok, awinyo woo madwoŋ ki yo neya, ento pe doŋ aniaŋ i gin mutimme-ni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka owacci, “Koŋ ilokke icuŋ ki kenyo.” Ci olokke ocun mot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
