            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, Lakuc bene obino, ci otugi wacci, “Akelo lok maber bot laditta kabaka! Pien Rwot otyeko lari ki i tek pa jo ducu ma onoŋo gutiŋo lweny i komi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka openyo Lakuc ni, “Lok mo pe marac i kom latinna Abcalom?” Lakuc ogamo ni, “Lumerokki ki jo ducu ma gutiŋŋe ka lweny i komi marac-ci gubed macalo latin awobi-ni, laditta kabaka.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cwiny kabaka opoto lirim, ci oa malo oito malo i kicika ma tye i ot ma i wi doggaŋ, ocako koko kun woto kwede, ma koko wode ni, “A woda Abcalom, woda Abcalom! Kono nene an aye ato ma kakari do! Oii Abcalom, woda, woda do!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
